{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"79898e061a39b2d2","__entryId":"text-truncate","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:42px;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\">\n          <b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">从 0 到 1 搭建设计系统：组件规范落地全记录</b>\n          <p class=\"trunc-clamp2\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-2);margin:4px 0 0\">覆盖 42 个组件的命名、状态与间距规范，附设计交付流程、走查清单与常见返工点。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:42px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\">\n          <b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">周末徒步路线推荐：从城市边缘走到云海之上</b>\n          <p class=\"trunc-clamp2\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-2);margin:4px 0 0\">三条一日往返路线，按难度分级，附交通方式、补给点和最佳出发时间。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--bg-soft);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;padding:7px 12px\">任务名称</span><span style=\"width:64px\">状态</span><span style=\"width:78px;text-align:right;padding-right:12px\">截止时间</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px\">\n        <span class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;padd